pretation\">67-df-reflexive-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b666228ffebaa5c8\" href=\"?note=b666228ffebaa5c8\" title=\"67-df-interpretation-pullback\">67-df-interpretation-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45559b2e50b02071\" href=\"?note=45559b2e50b02071\" title=\"67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization\">67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4787e57ce7daa89b\" href=\"?note=4787e57ce7daa89b\" title=\"67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek\">67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 8 章 §3，Theorem 5；导言 Lemma 1；印刷页 119、122；PDF 第 130、133 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"图像、陈述和有限一致性短推导已核对；一般源语言版本算术化完备性未完整重建"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是有限有效一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\)</span> 是一致 PR 公理呈示，采用本册固定强编号和证明算术化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一般解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{L,K}\">\\(\\unlhd_{L,K}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a>；一般语言的算术一致性句和代码有界公理片段取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a>。下标标出源、目标语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 的量化与公式编码均在元层。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RInt}_K(\\mathrm{PA},T,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{RInt}_K(\\mathrm{PA},T,t)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\mathrm{PB}_{L_A,K}(t,T)\">\\(P=\\mathrm{PB}_{L_A,K}(t,T)\\)</span>，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fb51163c70a06b3c\" href=\"?note=fb51163c70a06b3c\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-interpretation\">67-df-reflexive-interpretation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b666228ffebaa5c8\" href=\"?note=b666228ffebaa5c8\" title=\"67-df-interpretation-pullback\">67-df-interpretation-pullback</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 以定理闭句子集作为公理集，不假设该集合 PR。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>语法和证明参数固定为本册 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_K=c_K\">\\(g_K=c_K\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\">\\(e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\\)</span>；所有有限片段使用同一演算和该文件声明的程序图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_K\">\\(\\pi_K\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\\)</span>；本条所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-公理集及其有限片段的一致性句均由该系统绑定，因而包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\\)</span> 的 PA 内桥接条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(P\\vdash\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash t(\\varphi)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}(P,T,t),\\\\\n&amp;T\\unlhd_{K,L_A}P\\ \\land\\ P\\unlhd_{L_A,K}T.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(P\\vdash\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash t(\\varphi)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}(P,T,t),\\\\\n&amp;T\\unlhd_{K,L_A}P\\ \\land\\ P\\unlhd_{L_A,K}T.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>第一行是原书 Lemma1 的 pullback 可推导性对应，第二行是其指定解释。反身性给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}\">\\(P\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{T\\upharpoonright k}\\)</span>；第6章 Lemma2 的一般源语言版本遂给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\unlhd P\">\\(T\\unlhd P\\)</span>，即 Theorem5。</p>\n<p>源书第122页的来源记录要求允许一般源语言。本条现在引用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"4787e57ce7daa89b\" href=\"?note=4787e57ce7daa89b\" title=\"67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek\">67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek</a>，其源语言参数取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>，目标为 pullback 的定理等价 PR 算术呈示，不再调用仅允许算术源语言的窄接口，也不反向引用依赖本定理的一般目标判据。pullback 的 r.e. 公理集可用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"45559b2e50b02071\" href=\"?note=45559b2e50b02071\" title=\"67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization\">67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization</a> 换成定理等价 PR 呈示，以应用相应形式的第6章论证；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PB}\">\\(\\mathrm{PB}\\)</span> 的定义并不被改成 PR。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 8 章 §3，Theorem 5；导言 Lemma 1；印刷页 119、122；PDF 第 130、133 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：图像、陈述和有限一致性短推导已核对；一般源语言版本算术化完备性未完整重建。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-reflexive-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"fb51163c70a06b3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretation-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"b666228ffebaa5c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"45559b2e50b02071","anchor":"ref-4","targe